%% ---------------------------------------------------------------------
%% 3. SAFETY STATE MACHINE (as implemented today)
%% ---------------------------------------------------------------------
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE

    IDLE --> RUNNING : start()<br/>install input hooks + overlay + watchdog
    RUNNING --> PAUSED : Alt+P / pause()<br/>input lock -> passthrough
    PAUSED --> RUNNING : Alt+R / resume()<br/>input lock -> blocking
    RUNNING --> STOPPED : Alt+T / stop(reason)
    PAUSED --> STOPPED : Alt+T / stop(reason)
    RUNNING --> STOPPED : watchdog timeout<br/>no heartbeat for 120s
    RUNNING --> STOPPED : exception / close()
    PAUSED --> STOPPED : close()
    STOPPED --> [*]

    note right of RUNNING
        check() beats the watchdog and returns True
        wait() sleeps in <=100ms slices
        fill_row() checks before every field
    end note

    note right of PAUSED
        check() blocks the automation thread
        stop hotkey still works via the hook
        watchdog ignores PAUSED
        pause state is NOT persisted
        no pause timeout
    end note

    note right of STOPPED
        input hooks removed
        overlay shows STOPPED
        run state is written by the caller
    end note


